{
    "title": "Microsoft Outlook Lite: Email",
    "description": "The mail app with everything. Microsoft Outlook Lite is your favorite inbox, calendar and contacts app in a lighter package. Manage your schedule through your calendars, read and send emails and manage your contacts. Navigate through your emails with enhanced performance, small size and lightning speed with Microsoft Outlook Lite, now optimized for low-resource phones including Android Go phones.\r\n\r\nNever miss emails or meetings again. Microsoft Outlook Lite brings all of your favorite organization and planner features together all in one place, making your life easier than ever. Your inbox is always organized with flags and folders. Business email, school email or personal email, Outlook Lite will always protect and secure your emails and files with security for all your needs. Connect your email address from Outlook, Hotmail, other Microsoft accounts and Gmail. No matter your email address, stay in touch and avoid spam all with the help of Outlook Lite.\r\n\r\nCalendars are no longer a mess. Microsoft Outlook Lite is your planner that connects with everything. Calendars, schedules and meetings can all be managed in one place. Organize your calendar and book meetings instantly. Join calls and manage your calendar directly within the app.\r\n\r\nHaving issues with other email apps? Never worry about your emails again. Use Outlook Lite to send secure mail on the go, even with limited connection. With a built-in spam blocker and security, you can rest easy knowing your inbox is organized and always protected.\r\n\r\nGet emails and organize your calendar from anywhere. Now you can connect your email accounts through Outlook Lite and stay connected on the go. Outlook Lite works with Outlook, Hotmail, Live, MSN, Microsoft Exchange Online and Google accounts.\r\n\r\nDo more than any email app in a light and fast way on any network.\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT FOR EMAILS & CALENDARS WITH SMALL STORAGE\r\n\r\n\u2022 Small \u2013 The lite app has a small download size and uses extremely low storage on your phone\r\n\u2022 Fast - Optimized to run fast on all devices including devices with 1GB RAM\r\n\u2022 Low Battery Usage - Light on your phone saving your battery\r\n\u2022 All Networks - Works well even in 2G and 3G networks\r\n\r\nOUTLOOK LITE FEATURES:\r\n\r\nEmail Manager \u2013 Enjoy an Organized Inbox\r\n\u2022 Emails, organized for you: Read email, email friends and colleagues and see what matters the most.\r\n\u2022 Inbox organizer groups same subject emails & conversations for easier tracking in your inbox.\r\n\u2022 Automatic email management: display the most important messages first with swipe gestures & smart filters.\r\n\u2022 Organized inbox with custom flags, folders, and more for all kinds of email.\r\n\r\nPlanner & Calendar Organizer \u2013 Take Control of your Schedule\r\n\u2022 Calendar management gives you the ability to plan your day\r\n\u2022 Planner makes it easy to view, manage and schedule upcoming meetings\r\n\u2022 Calendar gives you easy access to join online video calls and meetings with Skype\r\n\u2022 Calendar and meeting invites are easy to RSVP from your inbox & send personalized comments.\r\n\r\nSecure Mail with Spam Blocker & Email Protection \u2013 Safe & Secure\r\n\u2022 Secure mail is built with security you can trust.\r\n\u2022 Security with simple, secure sign-on to authenticate & protect your identity.\r\n\u2022 Email app with built-in protection against viruses & spam email.\r\n\u2022 Junk mail detection sends all potential threats to the folder.\r\n\u2022 Advanced protection to keep your messages safe from phishing attacks & other online threats.\r\n\u2022 Microsoft security & privacy keeps your email, calendar, contacts & files safe.\r\n\r\nSMS Texts, Direct from your Email\r\n\u2022 Send text messages directly from the email app\r\n\u2022 Read and write any messages directly\r\n\u2022 Organize your text message inbox into helpful categories \r\n\u2022 Use messages to share your favorite articles or nearby places and engage with others while using the app\r\n\r\nConsumer Health Data Privacy Policy: https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2259814",
    "descriptionHTML": "The mail app with everything. Microsoft Outlook Lite is your favorite inbox, calendar and contacts app in a lighter package. Manage your schedule through your calendars, read and send emails and manage your contacts. Navigate through your emails with enhanced performance, small size and lightning speed with Microsoft Outlook Lite, now optimized for low-resource phones including Android Go phones.<br><br>Never miss emails or meetings again. Microsoft Outlook Lite brings all of your favorite organization and planner features together all in one place, making your life easier than ever. Your inbox is always organized with flags and folders. Business email, school email or personal email, Outlook Lite will always protect and secure your emails and files with security for all your needs. Connect your email address from Outlook, Hotmail, other Microsoft accounts and Gmail. No matter your email address, stay in touch and avoid spam all with the help of Outlook Lite.<br><br>Calendars are no longer a mess. Microsoft Outlook Lite is your planner that connects with everything. Calendars, schedules and meetings can all be managed in one place. Organize your calendar and book meetings instantly. Join calls and manage your calendar directly within the app.<br><br>Having issues with other email apps? Never worry about your emails again. Use Outlook Lite to send secure mail on the go, even with limited connection. With a built-in spam blocker and security, you can rest easy knowing your inbox is organized and always protected.<br><br>Get emails and organize your calendar from anywhere. Now you can connect your email accounts through Outlook Lite and stay connected on the go. Outlook Lite works with Outlook, Hotmail, Live, MSN, Microsoft Exchange Online and Google accounts.<br><br>Do more than any email app in a light and fast way on any network.<br><br>MANAGEMENT FOR EMAILS &amp; CALENDARS WITH SMALL STORAGE<br><br>\u2022 Small \u2013 The lite app has a small download size and uses extremely low storage on your phone<br>\u2022 Fast - Optimized to run fast on all devices including devices with 1GB RAM<br>\u2022 Low Battery Usage - Light on your phone saving your battery<br>\u2022 All Networks - Works well even in 2G and 3G networks<br><br>OUTLOOK LITE FEATURES:<br><br>Email Manager \u2013 Enjoy an Organized Inbox<br>\u2022 Emails, organized for you: Read email, email friends and colleagues and see what matters the most.<br>\u2022 Inbox organizer groups same subject emails &amp; conversations for easier tracking in your inbox.<br>\u2022 Automatic email management: display the most important messages first with swipe gestures &amp; smart filters.<br>\u2022 Organized inbox with custom flags, folders, and more for all kinds of email.<br><br>Planner &amp; Calendar Organizer \u2013 Take Control of your Schedule<br>\u2022 Calendar management gives you the ability to plan your day<br>\u2022 Planner makes it easy to view, manage and schedule upcoming meetings<br>\u2022 Calendar gives you easy access to join online video calls and meetings with Skype<br>\u2022 Calendar and meeting invites are easy to RSVP from your inbox &amp; send personalized comments.<br><br>Secure Mail with Spam Blocker &amp; Email Protection \u2013 Safe &amp; Secure<br>\u2022 Secure mail is built with security you can trust.<br>\u2022 Security with simple, secure sign-on to authenticate &amp; protect your identity.<br>\u2022 Email app with built-in protection against viruses &amp; spam email.<br>\u2022 Junk mail detection sends all potential threats to the folder.<br>\u2022 Advanced protection to keep your messages safe from phishing attacks &amp; other online threats.<br>\u2022 Microsoft security &amp; privacy keeps your email, calendar, contacts &amp; files safe.<br><br>SMS Texts, Direct from your Email<br>\u2022 Send text messages directly from the email app<br>\u2022 Read and write any messages directly<br>\u2022 Organize your text message inbox into helpful categories <br>\u2022 Use messages to share your favorite articles or nearby places and engage with others while using the app<br><br>Consumer Health Data Privacy Policy: https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2259814",
